.page-section.p-120-cont.cg-section.grey-light-bg.clearfix(id="pricing-link")
    .container
        .row
            .col-md-10.col-md-offset-1.text-center.mb-60
                h2.cg-section-title Engagements
                p.cg-section-lead Scoping starts with your stack, traffic patterns, AI usage, and business constraints. Below are typical shapes of work—not shopping-cart SKUs.
        .row
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    h3 Cost optimization audit
                    p.cg-meta Fixed scope · 2–4 weeks typical
                    ul
                        li Billing and resource inventory across AWS accounts
                        li Waste analysis: Lambda, API Gateway, data transfer, storage, and AI/inference spend
                        li AI-assisted pattern finding across configs and usage—engineer-reviewed recommendations
                        li Prioritized remediation list with expected savings bands
                    a.btn.btn-md.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Get an AWS cost analysis
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.cg-offer-card--featured.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    h3 Performance engineering sprint
                    p.cg-meta Time-boxed · senior engineers · AI-assisted
                    ul
                        li Production profiling and bottleneck analysis
                        li Go service, distributed systems, and AI call-path tuning
                        li Load validation against agreed scenarios
                        li Runbooks and monitoring gaps called out explicitly
                    a.btn.btn-md.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Book a performance audit
        .row
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    h3 Serverless migration program
                    p.cg-meta Phased · architecture-first
                    ul
                        li Domain boundaries and event design
                        li Lambda, queues, and integration patterns
                        li AI-assisted scaffolding for handlers and tests; humans own cutover risk
                        li Knowledge transfer for your platform team
                    a.btn.btn-md.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Request a systems review
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    h3 AI systems integration
                    p.cg-meta Architecture + implementation
                    ul
                        li Integrate LLMs into existing backends (Go, Lambda, event buses)
                        li Design async inference paths, retries, and failure isolation
                        li Cost and latency budgets for Bedrock and related AWS AI services
                        li Observability so AI features are operable by your on-call team
                    a.btn.btn-md.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Talk about AI integration
        .row
            .col-md-8.col-md-offset-2.text-center.mt-20
                p.cg-section-lead If you are unsure where to start, we begin with a short technical review and point you to the right engagement.
                a.btn.btn-lg.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Request a backend systems review
